[{"title":"送熊维藩尹婺川","author":"杨慎","text":"骊驹载道何骎骎，飞凫遥下蛮江浔。\n鸿雁不度牂牱国，虎豹常啼枫树林。\n鸣琴仙室白日静，锁印公堂朱夏深。\n冰蘖肯移清吏节，卉裳须服远人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3721,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张崇象新居","author":"杨慎","text":"碧山学士居茅屋，锦里先生过草堂。\n淼淼龙池接沟水，啾啾雀树隐邻墙。\n何人问字能携酒，有子摊书解满床。\n巴曲肯来收下里，楚歌还拟和沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3722,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送高三峰守太理","author":"杨慎","text":"赤廌青骢近侍臣，碧鸡金马问行频。\n南荒瘴厉禺山夜，北渚烟花洱海春。\n千里风谣采芳讯，十年云会阻光尘。\n赐金巳见先华省，鸣玉终期上紫宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3723,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵席仁同游昭应宫","author":"杨慎","text":"佩声齐下日华东，朝退春游有客同。\n却转河堤晴霭外，回瞻宫阙晓云中。\n曲江池泛仙源碧，下苑花交御宿红。\n琼玖水桃酬未得，青门紫陌兴何穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3724,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尚书九峰孙公寿诗","author":"杨慎","text":"百尺贞标涧底松，四朝公望想仪容。\n星辰衡岳当朱鸟，雷雨湘江起卧龙。\n白雪郢歌翻寿曲，青云奕叶继仙踪。\n天瓢满注供春雨，三岛遥应接九峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3725,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送福上人还青城","author":"杨慎","text":"青城三十六高峰，寺在青峰第几重。\n飞锡曾闻经雪岭，结茅常爱住云松。\n花飘香界诸天雨，金吼霜林半夜钟。\n传语禅关休上锁，虎溪他日会相从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3726,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庆成宴次张惟信韵","author":"杨慎","text":"太乙天坛望燎回，九重春宴选辰开。\n广庭列坐瞻华衮，合殿飘香入玉杯。\n海宇讴歌千载遇，云门队舞八荒来。\n共怜彩笔飘摇赋，独有金门侍从才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3727,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送毛东镇","author":"杨慎","text":"怜君心节之子孙，公车待诏重高门。\n江湖魏阙子牟远，暮田丙舍钟繇存。\n伏蒲内殿有膝迹，请剑上方犹血痕。\n凤雏骥子定须继，惩羡吹齑非尔伦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3728,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵刘润之岁暮见怀","author":"杨慎","text":"江曲横烟远树底，衡门榛草晚萋萋。\n美人明月劳相忆，游子浮云梦不迷。\n桂水舟航天堑北，松州车马雪峰西。\n愁来拟对公荣酒，醉里放歌严氏溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3729,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次祝鸣和中秋对月韵","author":"杨慎","text":"阁夜试看中夜月，桂花正在散花楼。\n仙客星轺下碧汉，美人旧隐怀丹丘。\n巳听笛奏乱归思，更对窗光惊醉眸。\n一水盈盈隔千里，佳期不共谢庄游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3730,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高泉临行再赋此以别","author":"杨慎","text":"异乡流落倚名公，公去穷荒望益穷。\n客路万三千里外，仙居七十二泉中。\n昌黎仰斗台光远，靖节停云时雨濛。\n铩羽涸鳞去安所，翾飞川咏几时同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3731,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题杨凌泉水木清华堂","author":"杨慎","text":"宛宛阑干石径斜，悠悠水木湛清华。\n桥通玉局仙人馆，邻接金绳大士家。\n翠锁渭川千亩月，红蒸杜曲一园花。\n刘安招隐歌丛桂，屈子离骚赋折麻。\n岚霭望山堪拄笏，陌尘流水任行车。\n闾儿好扫青苔壁，欲把新诗落墨鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3732,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观三塔寺龙女花","author":"杨慎","text":"天女来看龙树花，空香随步惹瓶沙。\n烟花点缀慈云薄，韶景留连慧日斜。\n鬘髻晓沾三昧雨，罗绵夜妒六铢霞。\n偷衔野鹿羞尘世，共命巢禽隔海涯。\n水泛暗通金母岛，风飘曾到玉皇家。\n谁教博望来西域，不并蒲桃上汉槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3733,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高峣积雨始晴迟简西峃","author":"杨慎","text":"长湖射雨万镞雄，屋角挂龙池饮虹。\n亭亭玉箸绕山阁，森森银竹围屏风。\n织女下机丝幂野，娋人入市珠跳空。\n画图未尽辋川妙，词赋讵信阳台工。\n停云巳拖楚练白，倒影忽放燕脂红。\n绿蚁幸自盈凿落，黄鸡不用歌玲珑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3734,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江万里图","author":"杨慎","text":"五才坎德迥灵长，万里岷山始滥觞。\n流汉天回经滟滪，盘涡谷转下柴桑。\n杨澜左蠡曾潭府，大壑归虚广莫乡。\n天遣阳侯分淼淼，帝咨神禹画茫茫。\n岑青翠观鲛人馆，水碧金膏龙伯堂。\n景浴阳乌朝旭早，燄然阴火夜霞光。\n烟寒星散三洲树，风致云飞百尺樯。\n鹤子凫雏喧澍雨，纹螺锦蚌映翔阳。\n笼筒津鼓惊浮客，欸乃渔歌属赧郎。\n泗磬石钟锵岛屿，轻涟频彩媚沧浪。\n投鞭堪笑苻坚策，静练难赓谢眺章。\n彩鹢退飞休借问，白鸥浩荡信徜徉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3735,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿华亭寺花树高于屋红霞夜照人声声枝上鸟也似惜馀春 其二 雨夕避漏起坐","author":"杨慎","text":"滞雨苍山夜，停灯伴独愁。\n诘朝明镜里，华鬓䬃先秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3736,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿华亭寺花树高于屋红霞夜照人声声枝上鸟也似惜馀春 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"云房迁雨榻，枕席籍盆罂。\n似向东林宿，莲花滴漏声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3737,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"积雨始晴","author":"杨慎","text":"霁晓凭高处，凉风吹我襟。\n海天堪倚杵，岭树小如簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3738,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三塔秋日","author":"杨慎","text":"始见椒花绿，又惊椒实红。\n客心正郁郁，作底对秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3739,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳桥弯","author":"杨慎","text":"涧壑浮白云，俯瞰低于马。\n云开见青松，又在涧壑下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3740,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西路杂述 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"沙远名乾海，坡高号望城。\n海曾无滴水，城亦是虚名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3741,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西路杂述 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"路学盘蛇上，人缘磨蚁旋。\n深于小有洞，阴过大漫天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3742,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西路杂述 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"濯足倒流水，回头相见坡。\n马嘶人又倦，落景在烟萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3743,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西路杂述 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"虎穴犹能入，猿梯亦可临。\n把关苗子面，开店主人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3744,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西路杂述 其五","author":"杨慎","text":"哨名一碗水，坡号半边山。\n疲人倚石磴，渴马饮冰湍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3745,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事一绝","author":"杨慎","text":"蘋末清风起，凉生近水楼。\n盈盈楼上女，齐唱楚江秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3746,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月五日夜与叙庵末庵乐庵得庵话别集句","author":"杨慎","text":"鼎鼎百年内，一别一回老。\n欲知万里情，坐对青灯晓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3747,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西兰图 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"兰为君子佩，植根不当门。\n幽谷发远馥，九畹咏王孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3748,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西兰图 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"兰为美人采，蘋藻掩芳洁。\n沐浴助精禋，岂为芗泽设。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3749,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西兰图 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"兰为仙姬名，升云女几山。\n玄景入天上，名字留人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3750,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西兰图 其四","author":"杨慎","text":"兰为王者香，郁鬯荐清庙。\n猗猗有遗音，并入瑶琴调。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3751,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉州登舟","author":"杨慎","text":"马上风尘倦，登舟似到家。\n雨晴凉意足，含笑对江花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3752,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渝江登陆 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"旷野惟看树，高城不见人。\n新梅临水发，照影为谁春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3753,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马枋桥","author":"杨慎","text":"无柰旅怀多，村酤引睡魔。\n醒醒不成寐，枫叶助吟哦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3754,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白石羹","author":"杨慎","text":"童子报仙翁，白石羹初熟。\n坐客不须尝，归家牚破腹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":3755,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"普鲁基晓发","author":"杨慎","text":"霜华重于雪，星光明似月。\n喔喔荒鸡鸣，萧萧征煚发。","collection":"明","notice":